Domain Entity StudentLearningObjective
    documentation 'This entity represents the competency assessed or evaluated for the student 
                  'against a specific Learning Objective.
    reference LearningObjective
        documentation 'The  LearningObjective evaluated or assessed for the student.
        is part of identity
    descriptor CompetencyLevel
        documentation 'The CompetencyLevel assessed for the student for the referenced LearningObjective.
        is required
    string DiagnosticStatement
        documentation 'A statement provided by the teacher that provides information in addition to the 
                      'grade or assessment score.
        is optional
        min length 1
        max length 1024
    reference GradingPeriod
        documentation 'Relates the LearningObjective to a grading period.
        is part of identity
        with context GradingPeriod
    reference Student
        documentation 'Relates the Student associated with the LearningObjective.
        is part of identity
    include StudentLearningObjectiveSectionOrProgramChoice
        documentation 'Relates the student and the Section or Program with the LearningObjective.
        is optional
